{"id":"n72147-1-18","stage":1,"title":"충분하다 · 充分","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72147-1-18-1","ko":"식물이 왜 이렇게 말라가는지 모르겠어요.","zh":"我不知道为什么植物会变得这么干枯。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"식물이","meaning":"植物","explanation":"식물：植物；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"식물","audio":"/audio/94f070de286f64678824.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65315","senseId":"1","lemma":"식물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"식물이","audio":"/audio/ea8ed5e6fea761b3c645.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"“이러하게(这样，这么)”的缩略语。","explanation":"이렇게：“이러하게(这样，这么)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71156","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"말라가는지","meaning":"干；表示动作、状态、状态变化的持续或进行。","explanation":"마르다：干；가다：表示动作、状态、状态变化的持续或进行。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"마르다","audio":"/audio/6cd2f7184df80453aa2c.mp3"},{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64677","senseId":"1","lemma":"마르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"28764","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말라가는지","audio":"/audio/d232fc03245c7632a14e.mp3"}},{"text":"모르겠어요.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르겠어요","audio":"/audio/262161281aabff06df61.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"94f070de286f6467","term":"식물","zh":"植物","audio":"/audio/94f070de286f64678824.mp3","entryId":"65315","definition":"与草木一样无法靠自身力量移动的生命体。","pronunciation":["싱물"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"9a767a1c9118d82c","term":"이렇게","zh":"“이러하게(这样，这么)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3","entryId":"71156","definition":"“이러하게(这样，这么)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"6cd2f7184df80453","term":"마르다","zh":"干","audio":"/audio/6cd2f7184df80453aa2c.mp3","entryId":"64677","definition":"水分全部蒸发而消失。","pronunciation":["마르다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"表示动作、状态、状态变化的持续或进行。","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"28764","definition":"表示动作、状态、状态变化的持续或进行。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d20ad502964f04c40ef8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72147-1-18-2","ko":"흙에 물이 충분하지 않아서 그런 것 같군요.","zh":"看来是土壤里的水分不够吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"흙에","meaning":"土，土壤","explanation":"흙：土，土壤；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"흙","audio":"/audio/fe84d047fd5593204ab9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73254","senseId":"1","lemma":"흙","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"흙에","audio":"/audio/848473c6f97791056b46.mp3"}},{"text":"물이","meaning":"水","explanation":"물：水；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"1","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물이","audio":"/audio/bbb693e9d07d2f260739.mp3"}},{"text":"충분하지","meaning":"充分，充足，足够","explanation":"충분하다：充分，充足，足够；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"충분하다","audio":"/audio/0e3ccf834eaa673e455d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72147","senseId":"1","lemma":"충분하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"충분하지","audio":"/audio/47a124c615bbd1383202.mp3"}},{"text":"않아서","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않아서","audio":"/audio/56e46f9e2892c9f61489.mp3"}},{"text":"그런","meaning":"那种，那样","explanation":"그런：那种，那样","readings":[{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60341","senseId":"1","lemma":"그런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같군요.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；군요：对新发现或新理解的情况表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같군요","audio":"/audio/500fe212ec4a0c75fe76.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"fe84d047fd559320","term":"흙","zh":"土，土壤","audio":"/audio/fe84d047fd5593204ab9.mp3","entryId":"73254","definition":"覆盖于地球表面、由小颗粒组成的物质。","pronunciation":["흑"]},{"id":"2e7edc957ce601f5","term":"물","zh":"水","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3","entryId":"17596","definition":"含在河、湖、海、地下水等，纯粹的且无色无香无味的透明液体。","pronunciation":["물"]},{"id":"0e3ccf834eaa673e","term":"충분하다","zh":"充分，充足，足够","audio":"/audio/0e3ccf834eaa673e455d.mp3","entryId":"72147","definition":"不欠缺，十分充裕。","pronunciation":["충분하다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]},{"id":"d14f5bfb24390ed9","term":"그런","zh":"那种，那样","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3","entryId":"60341","definition":"状态、模样、性质等那个样子的。","pronunciation":["그런"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/9b4190b4fabc3ccd8c5f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.025,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72147","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":57,"sequenceScore":2.6226,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["看来是土壤里的水分不够吧。","怎么哭得这么伤心？","我不知道为什么植物会变得这么干枯。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["看来是土壤里的水分不够吧。","我不知道为什么植物会变得这么干枯。","怎么哭得这么伤心？"],"answer":0}]}
